      "source": "Value object to capture custom conversion. <a href=\"JdbcCustomConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions</code></a> also act as factory for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/SimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder</code></a>",
