    {
      "source": "<a href=\"JdbcCustomConversions.JdbcConverterConfigurer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>JdbcCustomConversions.JdbcConverterConfigurer</code></a> encapsulates creation of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.ConverterConfiguration</code></a> with JDBC specifics.",
